12250 REM S0$: CURRENT SYMBOL
12260 REM X$: CURRENT INPUT CHARACTER
12270 REM: BI: INDEX IN SYMBOL TABLE WHERE CURRENT SCOPE STARTS
12280 REM: N3: VALUE (NUMERICAL) OF CURRENT SYMBOL
12290 REM: C$: VALUE (STRING) OF CURRENT SYMBOL
12300 REM: C1: P-CODE PROGRAM INDEX COUNTER
12310 REM: TDRIVER=0: MANUAL CONTROL, TDRIVER=1: AUTOMATIC CONTROL: THE P-CODE TO 8080 CODE TRANSLATOR IS CALLED UP AUTOMATICALLY AFTER SUCCESSFUL COMPILE
12320 REM: VI: WHEN PARSING A LIST, MARKS THE FIRST NAME IN THE SYMBOL TABLE OF THAT LIST. EG, IN "I, J, K : INTEGER", VI MARKS THE POSITION OF I IN THE SYMBOL TABLE
12330 REM: C7: COLUMN POSITION IN INPUT LINE OF CURRENT TOKEN, CORRECTED FOR TABS
12340 REM: C8: CHARACTER POSITION IN INPUT LINE, CORRECTED FOR TABS
12350 GOSUB 10280:REM GET NEXT SYMBOL IN S0$
12360 GOSUB 10170:REM GET NEXT CHARACTER IN X$
